{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095190/extras/8f5e4c96f4ba0d3b4cd3c57ebd2b2509.avif?t=1774892690\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angelica wakes up in the middle of the night to a loud knock at the door. But, taking her trusty flashlight and stepping out of the room, she discovers that the familiar corridors of her family mansion have changed. They have become endless, distorted, and full of quiet horror. This is not her home. It is a trap \u2014 a dream world that replicates her dwelling but is inhabited by nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095190/extras/703828f9490c5bd5a4fbae060936c59c.poster.avif?t=1774892690\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095190/extras/703828f9490c5bd5a4fbae060936c59c.webm?t=1774892690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095190/extras/703828f9490c5bd5a4fbae060936c59c.mp4?t=1774892690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in the nightmare loop, she must unravel the secrets of this place to find a way out. But this world thirsts to claim her pure soul to restore its power, and its inhabitants are already hunting her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095190/extras/8f5e4c96f4ba0d3b4cd3c57ebd2b2509.avif?t=1774892690\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095190/extras/944043c66a9b250a99513d280ead356e.poster.avif?t=1774892690\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095190/extras/944043c66a9b250a99513d280ead356e.webm?t=1774892690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095190/extras/944043c66a9b250a99513d280ead356e.mp4?t=1774892690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Surreal horror</strong>: Explore a constantly changing mansion where reality is distorted, and familiar places hide deadly dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Survive and learn</strong>: The world changes with each attempt. Study anomalies, memorize the locations of traps and enemies to progress further in the next try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Hunt for anomalies</strong>: Your main task is to find and interact with distortions of reality to unravel the secrets of the loop and weaken the grip of the nightmare dream world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Survival in the dark</strong>: Rely on your flashlight to light the way and ward off the darkness. Manage its charge wisely; if the light runs out, the darkness of this world will consume you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095190/extras/179ec519bba1e49ddca72314b3f8017c.poster.avif?t=1774892690\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095190/extras/179ec519bba1e49ddca72314b3f8017c.webm?t=1774892690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095190/extras/179ec519bba1e49ddca72314b3f8017c.mp4?t=1774892690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Do you dare to step into the dream world?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095190/extras/8f5e4c96f4ba0d3b4cd3c57ebd2b2509.avif?t=1774892690\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Nightmare Companion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4095190/93597735f4e7292f41e6c93787b7905eea873cf8.jpg"},{"name":"Weeping Maiden","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4095190/0ca7293e7686236e29a0110b408fc3e5f2a1a58e.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4095190/e61af0692f448e0211e74e6197f16c885f5b82b1.jpg"},{"name":"Gate, open!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4095190/4b865bb3c60551f3da87e6f7723c278fed4fb2c9.jpg"},{"name":"Terrible Secret","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4095190/482396b81498fd7994af938fec4285b0ebc6b8d3.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4095190?t=1774892690","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095190/88279b12af3261a74e4566a0db6d000935f25606/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774892690","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095190/51a8b01df70af674fae532b4b0bb726dbc5e69a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774892690","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095190/51a8b01df70af674fae532b4b0bb726dbc5e69a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774892690","catego